/* One-shot codemod: Claude Design `.dc.html` page -> React client component.
 * Template markup becomes JSX; the page's DCLogic class is kept verbatim so the
 * design's behaviour is preserved. Output goes to src/screens/generated/, which
 * is regenerated by this script: put hand-written changes in src/lib/ instead.
 * Mirrors the semantics of the design runtime (support.js): renderVals() merged
 * over props, sc-if truthiness, sc-for with $index, kebab props to camelCase on
 * imports, positional-only host styles. */
